---
import { ArrowRight, BookOpen, GitBranch, Package, Terminal } from 'lucide-react';
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const steps = [
  { number: '01', title: 'Pasang package', code: 'pnpm add @ahs-id/core @ahs-id/pupr-2023 @ahs-id/hsd-kaltim-2025' },
  { number: '02', title: 'Pilih bundle dan HSD', code: "import { createCalculator } from '@ahs-id/core'\nimport { bundle } from '@ahs-id/pupr-2023'\nimport { hsd } from '@ahs-id/hsd-kaltim-2025'" },
  { number: '03', title: 'Hitung dan ekspor', code: "const calculator = createCalculator(bundle, hsd)\nconst result = calculator.hitungHSP('3.1.1', {\n  jarak_buang_km: 5,\n  kondisi_jalan: 'sedang',\n  jenis_material: 'tanah_biasa',\n})" },
];
---

<SiteLayout title="Dokumentasi developer — AHS-ID" description="Quick start untuk memakai engine dan bundle data AHS-ID di project TypeScript.">
  <section class="border-b border-border/80 bg-card/45"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pb-14 pt-16 lg:px-8 lg:pb-20 lg:pt-24"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary"><Terminal aria-hidden="true" className="h-4 w-4" /> Dokumentasi developer</div><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-serif text-5xl leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-7xl">Bangun dari data yang terstruktur.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted-foreground">AHS-ID adalah monorepo TypeScript dengan engine kalkulasi, bundle koefisien, HSD regional, dan exporter. Mulai dari package yang Anda butuhkan.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="pressable inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm hover-fine-bg-primary-90" href="https://github.com/rachmad-jenss/ahs-id" rel="noreferrer">Buka GitHub <GitBranch aria-hidden="true" className="h-4 w-4" /></a><a class="pressable inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-background px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold hover-fine-bg-muted" href="https://www.npmjs.com/org/ahs-id" rel="noreferrer">Lihat npm <Package aria-hidden="true" className="h-4 w-4" /></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">{steps.map((step) => <article class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-7"><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">{step.number}</span><h2 class="mt-7 font-serif text-2xl">{step.title}</h2><code class="mt-5 block overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-foreground px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-background/85">{step.code}</code></article>)}</div>
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start"><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Peta package</p><h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em]">Pisahkan concern, sambungkan workflow.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Core menghitung. Bundle membawa koefisien. HSD memberi harga regional. Exporter mengubah hasil menjadi artefak kerja.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3"><a class="group pressable flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-5 hover-fine-border-primary" href="https://github.com/rachmad-jenss/ahs-id/tree/main/packages/core" rel="noreferrer"><span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">@ahs-id/core</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Calculator, validator, productivity, volume, margin</span></span><ArrowRight aria-hidden="true" className="h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground transition-[transform,color] duration-200 ease-out group-hover-fine-arrow" /></a><a class="group pressable flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-5 hover-fine-border-primary" href="https://github.com/rachmad-jenss/ahs-id/tree/main/packages/pupr-2023" rel="noreferrer"><span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">@ahs-id/pupr-2023</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Koefisien Permen PUPR 8/2023 dan master resources</span></span><ArrowRight aria-hidden="true" className="h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground transition-[transform,color] duration-200 ease-out group-hover-fine-arrow" /></a><a class="group pressable flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-5 hover-fine-border-primary" href="https://github.com/rachmad-jenss/ahs-id/tree/main/tests/golden" rel="noreferrer"><span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">tests/golden</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Regression fixtures lintas engine dengan toleransi epsilon 0,01 Rp</span></span><ArrowRight aria-hidden="true" className="h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground transition-[transform,color] duration-200 ease-out group-hover-fine-arrow" /></a></div></div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4 rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-6 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground sm:p-8"><BookOpen aria-hidden="true" className="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" /><p>API publik dan CLI masih berkembang mengikuti Phase 2. Untuk kontrak terbaru, lihat README, docs/architecture.md, dan source package pada branch utama.</p></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
